+        └────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
+                   /                                \
+      (isAllowed === false)                   (isAllowed === true)
+                 /                                    \
+                ▼                                      ▼
+    [FAIL-CLOSED INTERCEPTION]                 [INTENT PREPARATION]
+    - Set activeCommand to REJECTED            - createIntentFingerprint(...)
